</code></pre> <p><code>invoice.sign</code> takes a <code>FinalizedInvoice</code> by value. <code>SignedInvoice::xml</code>, <code>qr_code</code>, <code>invoice_hash</code>, <code>signature</code> and <code>public_key</code> return borrowed <code>&amp;str</code>; <code>zatca_key_signature</code> returns <code>Option&lt;&amp;str&gt;</code>. <code>to_xml_base64</code> returns <code>String</code>; <code>hash_base64</code> returns <code>Result&lt;String, SigningError&gt;</code>.</p> <p>Use <code>signed.signed_properties()</code> for <code>issuer()</code>, <code>serial()</code>, <code>cert_hash()</code>, <code>signed_props_hash()</code> and <code>signing_time()</code>, all borrowed <code>&amp;str</code>. Copy borrowed strings to retain them after dropping the invoice. Failures expose <code>SigningError::kind()</code> and structured details through the shared error type.</p> Call Return <code>Signer.from_pem(cert_pem: str, key_pem: str)</code> <code>Signer</code> <code>Signer.from_der(cert_der: bytes, key_der: bytes)</code> <code>Signer</code> <code>signer.certificate_pem()</code> / <code>certificate_der()</code> <code>str</code> / <code>bytes</code> <code>signer.sign_xml(xml: str)</code> <code>str</code> <code>finalized.sign(signer: Signer)</code> <code>SignedInvoice</code>; consumes finalized state <code>invoice_hash_base64_from_xml_str(xml: str)</code> <code>str</code> <p><code>SignedInvoice</code> string getters are <code>xml()</code>, <code>to_xml_base64()</code>, <code>qr_code()</code>, <code>invoice_hash()</code>, <code>hash_base64()</code>, <code>signature()</code>, <code>public_key()</code>, <code>issuer()</code>, <code>serial()</code>, <code>cert_hash()</code>, <code>signed_props_hash()</code> and <code>signing_time()</code>. <code>zatca_key_signature()</code> returns <code>str | None</code>. Strings and bytes are independent copies. Use context managers or <code>close()</code> for owners; errors raise the typed exceptions in errors.</p> Call Return <code>Signer.fromPem(certPem: string, keyPem: string)</code> <code>Signer</code> <code>Signer.fromDer(certDer: Array&lt;number&gt;, keyDer: Array&lt;number&gt;)</code> <code>Signer</code> <code>signer.certificatePem()</code> <code>string</code> <code>signer.certificateDer()</code> <code>Bytes</code> <code>signer.signXml(xml: string)</code> <code>string</code> <code>signer.sign(invoice: FinalizedInvoice)</code> <code>SignedInvoice</code>; consumes invoice state <code>Xml.hash(xml: string)</code> <code>string</code> <p><code>SignedInvoice</code> text getters: <code>xml()</code>, <code>toXmlBase64()</code>, <code>qrCode()</code>, <code>invoiceHash()</code>, <code>hashBase64()</code>, <code>signature()</code>, <code>publicKey()</code>, <code>issuer()</code>, <code>serial()</code>, <code>certHash()</code>, <code>signedPropsHash()</code>, <code>signingTime()</code>. Each returns <code>string</code>. <code>zatcaKeySignature()</code> returns optional <code>Text</code>; read its <code>value()</code> to obtain text.</p> <p>Objects use garbage-collected cleanup. <code>Bytes.asSlice()</code> returns a copied number array. Native failures throw an <code>Error</code> with a <code>BindingError</code> in <code>error.cause</code>; see error handling.</p> Call Return <code>Signer.FromPem(certPem: string, keyPem: string)</code> <code>Signer</code> <code>Signer.FromDer(certDer: byte[], keyDer: byte[])</code> <code>Signer</code> <code>signer.CertificatePem()</code> <code>string</code> <code>signer.CertificateDer()</code> <code>Bytes</code> <code>signer.SignXml(xml: string)</code> <code>string</code> <code>signer.Sign(invoice: FinalizedInvoice)</code> <code>SignedInvoice</code>; consumes invoice state <code>Xml.Hash(xml: string)</code> <code>string</code> <p><code>SignedInvoice</code> text getters: <code>Xml()</code>, <code>ToXmlBase64()</code>, <code>QrCode()</code>, <code>InvoiceHash()</code>, <code>HashBase64()</code>, <code>Signature()</code>, <code>PublicKey()</code>, <code>Issuer()</code>, <code>Serial()</code>, <code>CertHash()</code>, <code>SignedPropsHash()</code>, <code>SigningTime()</code>. Each returns <code>string</code>. <code>ZatcaKeySignature()</code> returns optional <code>Text</code>; read its <code>Value()</code> to obtain text.</p> <p>Dispose native owners, including optional <code>Text</code> and certificate <code>Bytes</code>. A <code>Bytes.AsSlice()</code> view must also be disposed; copy it with <code>Clone()</code> before releasing its owner. Native failures throw <code>BindingErrorException</code>; dispose its <code>Inner</code> after reading details.</p> Call Return <code>Signer.fromPem(certPem: String, keyPem: String)</code> <code>Signer</code> <code>Signer.fromDer(certDer: ByteArray, keyDer: ByteArray)</code> <code>Signer</code> <code>signer.certificatePem()</code> <code>String</code> <code>signer.certificateDer()</code> <code>Bytes</code> <code>signer.signXml(xml: String)</code> <code>String</code> <code>signer.sign(invoice: FinalizedInvoice)</code> <code>SignedInvoice</code>; consumes invoice state <code>Xml.hash(xml: String)</code> <code>String</code> <p><code>SignedInvoice</code> text getters: <code>xml()</code>, <code>toXmlBase64()</code>, <code>qrCode()</code>, <code>invoiceHash()</code>, <code>hashBase64()</code>, <code>signature()</code>, <code>publicKey()</code>, <code>issuer()</code>, <code>serial()</code>, <code>certHash()</code>, <code>signedPropsHash()</code>, <code>signingTime()</code>. Each returns <code>String</code>. <code>zatcaKeySignature()</code> returns optional <code>Text</code>; read its <code>value()</code> to obtain text.</p> <p>Use <code>use</code> or <code>close()</code> for native owners, including optional <code>Text</code> and certificate <code>Bytes</code>. <code>Bytes.asSlice()</code> returns a copied <code>ByteArray</code>. Failures throw <code>BindingException</code>.</p> Call Return <code>Signer.fromPem(certPem: String, keyPem: String)</code> <code>Signer</code> <code>Signer.fromDer(certDer: byte[]